{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y压缩了部分心理转折，少了X中“早知道这样还会不会走”等具体犹疑，使人物动摇的因果过程略显单薄。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的主句更短，【】直接凸显每段的心理支点，感受又按音乐时点出现，观众可以边听边扫，比较容易抓住叙事主线。它的感受描述也更具体，能从音色、节奏、旋律走向和身体反应呈现细腻变化，而不只是给情绪贴标签。X的优势是心理因果交代得更充分，但Y在重点识别、音乐与叙事呼应以及感受的具体程度上整体更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0f2b1010-1fb8-45ab-8913-528cd7bd4f3f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T062927299350Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:30:31.874538+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9f8f6c1bbd5bdcab46e9e17bf9339f3a1b1510bf6116c39603f6b336e62c3396", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000